		{"id":"8fa4842d172aac7c","x":-700,"y":-320,"width":1140,"height":520,"type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nflowchart TB\n \n  subgraph Ingest[\"Input / Context Signal Layer\"]\n\tdirection LR\n \n\tsubgraph Internal[\"Internal Signals\"]\n\t  direction TB\n\t  A1[Sales ↔ Lead Emails]\n\t  A2[Internal Team Discussions\nabout Lead]\n\t  A3[Sales Notes / Call Summaries]\n\t  A4[Excel / CRM Tracking Sheets]\n\t  A5[\"Team Chat Threads\n(Slack / Teams)\"]\n\tend\n \n\tsubgraph External[\"External Signals\"]\n\t  direction TB\n\t  A6[External News / Signals\nabout Lead or Company]\n\tend\n  end\n \n  subgraph Gateway[\"Context Ingestion Gateway\"]\n\tdirection TB\n\tG1[Source Connectors]\n\tG2[Auth / Permissions Check]\n\tG3[Fetch / Poll / Webhook Intake]\n\tG4[Content Parsing]\n\tG5[Attachment / Link Resolver]\n\tG6[Message Threading]\n\tG7[PII / Sensitive Data Filter]\n\tG8[Source Tagging / Metadata]\n\tG9[Canonical Event Builder]\n \n\tG1 --> G2 --> G3 --> G4 --> G5 --> G6 --> G7 --> G8 --> G9\n  end\n \n  A1 --> G1\n  A2 --> G1\n  A3 --> G1\n  A4 --> G1\n  A5 --> G1\n  A6 --> G1\n \n  subgraph Extraction[\"Entity & Context Extraction\"]\n\tdirection TB\n\tE1[LLM Extraction Engine]\n\tE2[\"Structured Output Schema\n(Lead, Company, People, Dates, Signals)\"]\n\tE3[Validation / Deduplication]\n\tE4[Timeline & Relationship Normalization]\n \n\tE1 --> E2 --> E3 --> E4\n  end\n \n  G9 --> E1\n \n  subgraph Guardrails[\"Policy & Guardrails\"]\n\tdirection TB\n\tP1[Identity Resolution]\n\tP2[Source Attribution]\n\tP3[Temporal Reasoning]\n\tP4[Evidence Thresholds]\n\tP5[Confidence Scoring]\n\tP6[Privacy / Access Control]\n\tP7[Conflict Detection]\n\tP8[Exception Routing]\n \n\tP1 --> P2 --> P3 --> P4 --> P5 --> P6 --> P7 --> P8\n  end\n \n  E4 --> P1\n \n  subgraph KB[\"Lead Knowledge Base\"]\n\tdirection TB\n\tK1[Lead Profile]\n\tK2[Company Profile]\n\tK3[People / Stakeholders]\n\tK4[Interaction Timeline]\n\tK5[Signal Facts]\n\tK6[Evidence Store]\n\tK7[Versioned State]\n\tK8[Confidence Scores]\n\tK9[Relationship Graph]\n\tK10[Search Index / Embeddings]\n \n\tK1 --> K2\n\tK1 --> K3\n\tK1 --> K4\n\tK4 --> K5\n\tK5 --> K6\n\tK6 --> K7\n\tK7 --> K8\n\tK3 --> K9\n\tK5 --> K9\n\tK1 --> K10\n  end\n \n  P6 --> KB\n  P5 --> KB\n \n  subgraph Reconcile[\"Reconciliation Engine\"]\n\tdirection TB\n\tR1[Match New Signal to Existing Knowledge]\n\tR2[Merge / Update Policy]\n\tR3[Versioning / Change History]\n\tR4[Audit Trail]\n \n\tR1 --> R2 --> R3 --> R4\n  end\n \n  KB --> R1\n  R4 --> U[Update Knowledge State]\n  U --> KB\n \n  P8 --> Q[Review Queue]\n \n  subgraph Human[\"Human Review Service\"]\n\tdirection TB\n\tH1[Review Conflicts / Low Confidence Cases]\n\tH2[Approve / Reject / Amend]\n\tH3[Feedback to Rules and Models]\n \n\tH1 --> H2 --> H3\n  end\n \n  Q --> H1\n  H3 --> P1\n  H3 --> E1\n  H2 --> R1\n``` "}
